# 2026-06-17 22:27:33.644156
+Add pipeline recipe templates system:
+
+1. Add RECIPE_TEMPLATES dict and GET /pipeline/recipes endpoint in main.py
+2. Add recipe picker UI and JS in index.html
+
+### Backend change in main.py (add before the routes section):
+
+```python
+RECIPE_TEMPLATES = {
+    'skincare': {'name': 'skincare', 'label': '🧴 Skincare Glow', 'description': 'Soft luxury vibes, calm music, slow transitions', 'ugc_style': 'product_usage', 'sound_style': 'luxury_jazz', 'mood': 'calm', 'duration': 10, 'bgm_style': 'luxury_jazz'},
+    'gadget': {'name': 'gadget', 'label': '📱 Gadget Unboxing', 'description': 'Fast-paced, energetic, quick cuts', 'ugc_style': 'holding_product', 'sound_style': 'upbeat_pop', 'mood': 'energetic', 'duration': 8, 'bgm_style': 'upbeat_pop'},
+    'fashion': {'name': 'fashion', 'label': '👗 Fashion Lookbook', 'description': 'Elegant slow-mo, chic aesthetic', 'ugc_style': 'talking_head', 'sound_style': 'chill_loft', 'mood': 'luxurious', 'duration': 8, 'bgm_style': 'chill_loft'},
+    'food': {'name': 'food', 'label': '🍜 Food Review', 'description': 'Warm ASMR-style close-up shots', 'ugc_style': 'ugc_review', 'sound_style': 'asmr', 'mood': 'fun', 'duration': 10, 'bgm_style': 'asmr'},
+    'asmr': {'name': 'asmr', 'label': '🎧 ASMR Unboxing', 'description': 'Quiet ambient gentle sounds relaxing', 'ugc_style': 'product_usage', 'sound_style': 'asmr', 'mood': 'calm', 'duration': 12, 'bgm_style': 'asmr'},
+}
+
+@app.get('/pipeline/recipes')
+def get_recipes():
+    return {'recipes': list(RECIPE_TEMPLATES.values())}
+```
+
+### Frontend changes in index.html:
+
+In the Content tab, near the generate form (look for style-select-grid and sound style):
+1. Add BEFORE the existing style-select-grid: a div with id="recipePicker" showing recipe cards
+2. Add hidden input: <input type="hidden" id="selectedRecipe" value="gadget">
+3. Add JS function loadRecipes() that fetches GET /pipeline/recipes and populates recipePicker
+4. Add JS function selectRecipe(name) that highlights the card
+5. Call loadRecipes() in the DOMContentLoaded init section
+6. When generating video, send recipe name as 'recipe' in the request body
+
+Recipe cards CSS should use existing .style-card class layout:
+<div class="style-card selected" data-recipe="gadget" onclick="selectRecipe('\''gadget'"')" title="Fast-paced energetic quick cuts">
+  <div style="font-size:24px">📱</div>
+  <div class="font-medium" style="font-size:12px">Gadget Unboxing</div>
+  <div class="text-xs text-secondary">Fast-paced quick cuts</div>
+</div>
+
+Keep the existing style-select-grid and advanced options below the recipe picker.
+Recipe selection is a shortcut that pre-fills style/sound/mood/duration in the form.

